# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore file (context = sangam/): only the UI sources, the deploy/docker/ui files and deploy/fonts.
**
!sangam-ui/**
sangam-ui/node_modules/**
sangam-ui/coverage/**
!deploy/docker/ui/**
# Decision 120: the approved UI fonts (hash-checked by sangam-ui/scripts/deploy-fonts.mjs at build time).
!deploy/fonts/**
